111
00:33:38,555 --> 00:33:43,555
この結末は 誰も知らない
...no one knows how this will end.

112
00:33:43,555 --> 00:33:47,055
君を信じる そう決めているから
I believe in you, because I've decided to...

113
00:33:47,055 --> 00:33:50,055
どんな 異常 非常も
...no matter how abnormal or extraordinary...

114
00:33:50,055 --> 00:33:55,055
乗り越えられるよ
...we can overcome it!

115
00:33:56,055 --> 00:34:00,555
月光 この闇に唯一 凛と咲く華
Moonlight, the only flower blooming with dignity in this darkness.

116
00:34:00,555 --> 00:34:04,555
恐れなのか 憧れなのか
Is it fear, or is it longing?

117
00:34:04,555 --> 00:34:07,355
向かい合う夜空
Facing the night sky...

118
00:34:07,355 --> 00:34:10,555
大地を駆け抜ける
...running across the earth...

119
00:34:10,555 --> 00:34:13,255
私と君が創り出す
...you and I will create...

120
00:34:13,255 --> 00:34:16,255
この物語 単純な未来じゃない
...this story, it's not a simple future.

121
00:34:16,255 --> 00:34:19,555
湧き立つ情熱 この声に乗せよう
Let's put this welling passion into this voice.

122
00:34:19,555 --> 00:34:22,555
空翔ぶ 羽根なくても
Even without wings to fly in the sky...

123
00:34:22,555 --> 00:34:25,555
手は繋げられたから
...since our hands are held together...

124
00:34:25,555 --> 00:34:28,055
この運命を選んだ
